  (text "POWER FLAGS (ERC)" (at 22.86 243.31 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 69a54017-f4c8-56d7-acfb-69d1916f5e4b)
  )
  (text "NOTES" (at 20.32 258.55 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d48e5d17-7608-5a77-b4fa-68445782e408)
  )
  (text "1. Header pins 2 and 4 (Jetson 5 V) are intentionally unconnected: the HAT runs from PWR_5V_AUX on J2."
    (at 20.32 262.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 032b552e-9e30-515f-b611-86733fbd5b00)
  )
  (text "2. R1 sets the MAX98357A SD_MODE level with the amp's internal pull-down; 634k from 3.3 V targets (L+R)/2. Verify against the SD_MODE table."
    (at 20.32 266.17 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c315fd09-97ad-5480-a0ce-5322c6a580e8)
  )
  (text "3. U2 uses the 74LVC125 symbol (same pinout); fit a 74AHCT125 so 3.3 V inputs give 5 V outputs."
    (at 20.32 269.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 425835f7-e222-510d-9dde-3c2dac7b165a)
  )
  (text "4. OUT_EN low (boot/reset): Q1 off, OUT_EN_N high, U2 outputs Hi-Z and pulled low. Lights off, no servo pulses."
    (at 20.32 273.79 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b4d9c82e-fe08-5c9a-8e1e-d8a9df6018a6)
  )
  (text "5. R17/R18 I2C pull-ups are DNP. Fit only if the carrier has none on pins 3/5."
    (at 20.32 277.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c5c1fb7b-833f-5deb-8481-e6c370c56537)
  )

